/sbom*.json
#  BOTH bills of materials are deliverables: they stay version-controlled.
#  The software's ships inside the packages; the project's also covers the
#  firmware (Pico SDK, TinyUSB, ARM toolchain). The rule above was only ever
#  aimed at the reports produced by continuous integration.
!/sbom.cdx.json
!src/phytoscope/sbom.cdx.json
!sources/software/MANIFESTE.json
